sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Dashboard as Dashboard UI/App
    participant Supabase as Supabase Auth
    participant Cookie as Browser Cookie Jar
    participant Unity as Unity WebGL App
    participant Hyperfy as Hyperfy Client App
    participant HServer as Hyperfy Server

    User->>Browser: Navigate to dashboard login/signup
    Browser->>Dashboard: Load dashboard app
    User->>Dashboard: Submit credentials or signup form
    Dashboard->>Supabase: signInWithPassword / signUp
    Supabase-->>Dashboard: Session + access_token + user metadata
    Dashboard->>Cookie: Set metadyn_token for .metadyn.xyz
    Dashboard-->>Browser: Authenticated dashboard state

    par Unity path
        User->>Browser: Open Unity space URL
        Browser->>Unity: Load Unity app shell
        Unity->>Cookie: Read metadyn_token
        alt No cookie
            Unity-->>Browser: Redirect to dashboard login with redirect param
            Browser->>Dashboard: Open login page
            Dashboard->>Cookie: Set metadyn_token after auth
            Dashboard-->>Browser: Redirect back to Unity URL
            Browser->>Unity: Reload Unity app
            Unity->>Cookie: Re-read metadyn_token
            Unity-->>User: Continue into Unity world
        else Cookie present
            Unity-->>User: Continue into Unity world immediately
        end
    and Hyperfy path
        User->>Browser: Open Hyperfy space URL
        Browser->>Hyperfy: Load Hyperfy client bundle
        Hyperfy->>Cookie: Read metadyn_token
        alt No cookie
            Hyperfy-->>Browser: Redirect to dashboard login with redirect param
            Browser->>Dashboard: Open login page
            Dashboard->>Cookie: Set metadyn_token after auth
            Dashboard-->>Browser: Redirect back to Hyperfy URL
            Browser->>Hyperfy: Reload Hyperfy app
            Hyperfy->>Cookie: Re-read metadyn_token
        else Cookie present
            Hyperfy->>HServer: Open websocket with authToken query param
            HServer-->>Hyperfy: Authenticated snapshot
            Hyperfy-->>User: Continue into Hyperfy world
        end
    end
